        link quote macro.quote.html @85,429,11,20
        text Experimental @108,429,26,20
      text quote!(..) accepts arbitrary tokens and expands into a TokenStream describing the input. For example, quote!(a + b) will produce an expression, that, when evaluated, constructs the TokenStream [Ident("a"), Punct('+', Alone), Ident("b")]. @146,409,565,60
